    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to \"just breathe\" when it feels like the damage is permanent. if i keep going like this, i'm just gonna keep failing them. it feels like the only way to actually stop causing them shame would be if i wasn't even around to mess things up anymore. like, if i just disappeared, at least the failure wouldn't be spreading.",
